{
  "tema": 7086,
  "slug": "debido-a",
  "titulo": "Debido a / debido a que: because of, due to",
  "subtitulo": "Debido a la lluvia / debido a que llovió.",
  "foto": "t07.jpg",
  "regla": "Debido a + noun = because of, due to; debido a que + full sentence (with a verb) = because. Debido a can be replaced by por.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To say _because of_ or _due to_, use **debido a**. It's a bit more formal than **por** or **porque**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Structure",
            "Followed by",
            "Example"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "debido a",
              "a noun (with its articles, possessives, even a clause after it)",
              "Cancelaron debido a la lluvia."
            ],
            [
              "debido a que",
              "a full sentence with a verb",
              "Cancelaron debido a que llovió."
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Debido a** can be replaced by **por** without changing the meaning: **por la lluvia**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Debido a que** can never be followed by just a noun."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Remember **a + el = al**: **debido al viento**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: noun → **debido a**; verb → **debido a que**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Muchos jóvenes tienen que emigrar ==debido a== la crisis.",
              "en": "Many young people have to emigrate because of the crisis."
            },
            {
              "es": "Lola y Miguel terminaron ==debido a== su egoísmo.",
              "en": "Lola and Miguel broke up because of his selfishness."
            },
            {
              "es": "Le dimos el premio a Carmen ==debido a== la creatividad que siempre muestra.",
              "en": "We gave Carmen the prize because of the creativity she always shows."
            },
            {
              "es": "No salimos a surfear ==debido al== viento.",
              "en": "We didn't go surfing because of the wind."
            },
            {
              "es": "Cancelaron el vuelo ==debido a que== había mucha neblina.",
              "en": "They canceled the flight because there was a lot of fog."
            },
            {
              "es": "No salimos a surfear ==por== el viento.",
              "en": "We didn't go surfing because of the wind."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
